# Secrets — API keys never get committed (public repo).
*.env
!*.env.example

# Data outputs — this repo holds process, not deliverables.
# Run logs are regenerable scrape output (swept to _archive/ by run hygiene), never deliverables.
*.log
# Client lists, contacts, and PII never get committed.
*.csv
*.json
!scripts/**/*.json   # allow config/fixtures if ever needed
/data/
/out/
*.xlsx

# Client process files (config, runsheet) are process, not deliverables — allow them.
# Run outputs under clients/ (leads*.csv, clay.csv, *.jsonl, reports) stay ignored by the rules above.
# Only the CLIENT-ROOT config + runsheet are process. One level deep on purpose: '**' also
# matched run-folder artifacts (heal-N-runsheet.csv, border-runsheet.csv), which are regenerable.
!clients/*/*-config.json
!clients/*/*-runsheet.csv
